To: ann@example.org
Subject: Your Boardly account will be deleted on 8 November 2026, 10:00 UTC

Hello,

your Boardly account will be deleted on 8 November 2026, 10:00 UTC, as you requested. All of your dashboards, favourites, notes and files will be removed then, and this can't be undone.

If you want to keep your account, sign in before then and choose "Cancel deletion":
https://dash.example.org/

This is the last email you will receive from Boardly. No further emails will be sent, not even when the account has been deleted.

– Boardly

